# Cloudflare Pages 响应头（GitHub Pages 会忽略本文件）
# HTML 保持每次校验（部署后立刻生效），图片类静态资源放长缓存

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(self), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies: none
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://busuanzi.ibruce.info; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://ipwho.is https://ipapi.co https://geocoding-api.open-meteo.com https://api.open-meteo.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://cloudflareinsights.com; frame-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

/favicon.ico
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

# Service Worker 本体必须每次校验：浏览器靠它发现新版本，缓存住就永远不更新
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
  Service-Worker-Allowed: /

# Pages 把 /offline.html 308 到 /offline，实际对外的是 /offline，两条都配
/offline
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/offline.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

# 订阅源：半小时缓存，既不给回源施压，也不至于让新文章迟迟不出现
/feed.xml
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=1800
  Content-Type: application/rss+xml; charset=utf-8

# CSP 已启用：站内大量内联脚本，所以 script-src 保留 'unsafe-inline'；
# 白名单只放 Cloudflare 统计与不蒜子，天气 / IP 接口走 connect-src。
# 以后新增第三方脚本或接口必须同步这里，否则会被浏览器直接拦掉。
# Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin 同时充当图片与脚本的防盗链：
# 别的站用 <img>/<script>/fetch 引用本站资源会被浏览器拒绝。

/assets/*.webp
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/assets/*.avif
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/assets/*.jpg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/assets/*.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/assets/*.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

# 样式与脚本保持重新校验：ETag 命中返回 304，避免部署后用户长时间看到旧版本
/assets/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/assets/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# 接口禁止被搜索引擎收录（robots 里也 Disallow 了，双保险）
/api/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Cache-Control: no-store
